; Disposable WB 3.1 Execute pre-scan probe. Output is retained in S:Shell-Startup.
FailAt 1
C:MakeDir RAM:T
Assign T: RAM:T
Echo "BEGIN" >S:Shell-Startup
Echo ".KEY filename" >RAM:execute-probe
Echo "Echo {filename} >>S:Shell-Startup" >>RAM:execute-probe
Echo ".BRA {" >>RAM:execute-probe
Echo ".KET }" >>RAM:execute-probe
C:Execute RAM:execute-probe fallback
Echo "END" >>S:Shell-Startup
EndCLI >NIL:
